{"pull": {"id": "number:20986", "number": 20986, "title": "KAFKA-19888: Clamp negative values in coordinator histograms", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:43:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-26T14:25:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-26T14:25:40Z", "user": {"login": "squah-confluent", "id": 163298686, "node_id": "U_kgDOCbu9fg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163298686?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent", "html_url": "https://github.com/squah-confluent", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The coordinator runtime and group coordinator currently use wall clock\ntime to measure durations for metrics. When the system clock goes\nbackwards due to time adjustments, we attempt to record negative\ndurations for metrics, which throws an ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException\nexception. This causes request processing and partition loading to fail\nwhile the clock is being adjusted. If partition loading fails, the group\nthe coordinator for that partition becomes unavailable until the broker\nis restarted or leadership changes again.\n\nTo address this, we clamp negative durations to zero in histograms\ninstead of throwing ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsExceptions. We will move\ntowards using a monotonic clock for metrics in future work.\n\nReviewers: David Jacot <djacot@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 8846059803, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAACD0QpGw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/group-coordinator", "name": "group-coordinator", "color": "9AFD22", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20986"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_squah-confluent_is_pr.json"}